豬大骨的精華，經12小時慢火熬煮，湯色乳黃、濃郁綿厚，滿滿的膠原蛋白與極致鮮味，讓每一口都像在擁抱溫暖的幸福。\n\n🌟 叉燒香氣升級\n以日本職人工法製作的五花肉燒肉叉燒，搭配國產純釀醬油低溫熟成，炙燒的梅納反應更添濃郁香氣。每一片叉燒都鎖住鮮甜肉汁，入口即化，滿足每一位饕客的期待。\n\n🌟 麵條口感升級\n嚴選美澳黃金小麥，經九道揉壓工法製成的26番切細麵，硬中帶Q，完美吸附湯頭精華。每一口麵條，都是精工細作的體現。\n好呷豆花的三大堅持 |\n✅ 天然非基改大豆：手工鹽滷製作，不含石膏，口感細緻滑嫩。\n✅ 40年傳承秘糖水：嘉義糖廠老員工的獨門技法，選用純甘蔗熬煮，濃郁不膩。\n✅ 綿密配料：飽滿紅豆、古早味大麥、低糖綠豆，每一口都是回憶的味道。\n\n甜品起家的何家，保留古早味！ 愛吃甜品的朋友們，來好呷拉麵，記得留點胃給這碗 「被拉麵耽誤的豆花」！甜品吃到飽，ho-chia，好呷❤️"],["https://www.google.com/local/place/rap/merchantdescription","https://support.google.com/legal/troubleshooter/1114905#ts\u003d1115658%2C1115689"]],null,null,"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-T4-hSmsFf7U/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/IrKgbxoxyeA/s44-p-k-no-ns-nd/photo.jpg",null,null,null,null,null,null,[[0,"拉麵店"],"查看相似地點"],[1],"新北市三重區仁德里",null,null,null,null,[[["CgIgAQ\u003d\u003d","0ahUKEwjGu-_Mv9KWAxVkYvUHHXwzEt4QhbADCOMCKAA","全部",[["CIABIhC-zz3bDqYutMLr4bHhjrFf",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/AHRPTWlQTH_rJVTvaXpyPMcu8FGhMqAerl_M0Y7Cnmelbbi5wDv1sTDjZABF5qVyVf1mM1lR5tvD7Gg1YZOiJiuy9x5-D-V_XEvRK0LyVti5Jh4Zvl6ZvTegbdwOMmGGH2RCq61fetg27Sxbnc0\u003dw286-h298-k-no","",[700,729],[203,100]],null,[[3,121.49794519999999,25.061661100000002],[0,90],[700,729],75],"bnOZasbMKuTE1e8P_ObI8A0","0ahUKEwjGu-_Mv9KWAxVkYvUHHXwzEt4QzCcI5AIoAA",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[10,"CIABIhC-zz3bDqYutMLr4bHhjrFf"],[10,3,[729,700]],null,null,[[[2],[[null,null,25.061661100000002,121.49794519999999]]]],[1,null,null,[5,2],null,[null,null,"bizbuilder:gmb_on_local_universal_desktop",[6,7,4,1,3]],null,null,[2025,11,24,6]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["UGCS_REFERENCE","CIABIhC-zz3bDqYutMLr4bHhjrFf||","1"]],1,null,null,null,null,null,null,["3765758837284193815","-1171228089672577487"],null,"aXdwbhO17TE"]],null,null,null,null,null,null,0,1,null,0],["CgIgARICGAI\u003d","0ahUKEwjGu-_Mv9KWAxVkYvUHHXwzEt4QhbADCOUCKAE","最新",[["CIABIhBUja4A5XRgxHdK__8jxExV",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s